& [Delineation]
  + semantic compilation authors and binds a conventional build candidate while Cargo rustc linker and other toolchains actually form native artifacts
  + pre-build expected output identity is distinct from post-build content digest and receipt
  + build verification signing admission packaging installation deployment and execution remain separate identities

& [SpecificationJustificationSolution]
  + [source] user three-level compilation intent is preserved with exact external-binary interpretation
  + [justification] the third backend needs an honest conventional build model before any subprocess authority exists
  + [solution_boundary] strict pure Rust CLI candidate forms and projection only

& [DataDrivenDesign]
  + SourceInputPin owns path policy digest provenance and semantic node bindings
  + NativeToolchainPin owns language edition channel compiler Cargo target linker and configuration identities
  + NativeBuildContract owns manifests lock profile features command schema limits environment policy expected output verification and cleanup
  + NativeArtifactCandidate owns upstream lineage interface future runtime requirements rollback unresolved non-authority and digest
  + post-build ArtifactReceipt is explicitly deferred

& [DualHemisphereThinking]
  + [divergent] direct binary synthesis C C++ Go Rust WASM HDL FPGA and self-hosted code generation were considered
  + [convergent] one existing locked Rust CLI target is the smallest grounded candidate profile
  + [holistic] the form exposes the whole native pipeline without allowing intention source compiler artifact trust installation and behavior to collapse

& [SevenFoldExplosion]
  + Honesty forbids invented artifact digests reproducibility and executable behavior claims
  + Security pins source lock toolchain target features bounds output path rollback and future authority gates
  + Weaver joins semantic IR source inputs package manifests toolchain interface and expected output
  + Planner orders candidate projection sandbox build verification signing admission installation and execution
  + Refiner selects Rust CLI P0 and keeps other languages hardware and actual build outside
  + Scribe retains every digest version command input limit residual and receipt boundary
  + Observer closes only after adversarial focused regression workspace lint format evidence and diff gates

& [FeatureRequirementSupport]
  + every candidate statement maps to NAB-001 through NAB-009 in the Slice5 matrix

& [Decision]
  + activate pure NativeArtifactBackend Rust CLI candidate forms only
  + leave source Cargo lock CLI behavior and all external tool execution unchanged
